              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Alloy 403 is a straight chromium stainless steel that demonstrates reasonable corrosion resistance, high mechanical characteristics, and offers heat resistance and a scaling temperature of about 1300°F. 304 is corrosion and heat resistant martensitic stainless steel that offers a wide range of mechanical properties obtainable by appropriate heat treating. Easily hardened by oil, fan or air cooling and can be tempered at temperatures at 1350°F (732°C) to improve fracture toughness."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel product forms offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Round Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-stainless-steel-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Hex Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-stainless-steel-hex-bar)"
                }
